<title>GERMANY: German August steel output falls 0.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>German August steel output falls 0.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office gave the following data on pan-German steel production (in millions of tonnes):</p>
<p>			  Aug	     Pct change</p>
<p>    Pig iron	  2.26	    -2.8</p>
<p>    Crude steel     3.25	    -0.7</p>
<p>			 Jan-Aug	  Pct Change</p>
<p>    Pig iron	 18.03	    -11.3</p>
<p>    Crude steel    25.84	   -9.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Percentage changes are against year-earlier figures.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
